OL,3,GNEWSAEnd to End Walk: Route, timings
OL,4,Aand closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of competitors will take on
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man's End to End Walk on
OL,8,FSunday, covering 39 miles (63km) from
OL,9,Fthe Point of Ayre to The Sound.
OL,11,FThe event, organised by the Isle of Man
OL,12,FVeteran Athletes' Club, is one of the
OL,13,FIsland's longest-running endurance
OL,14,Fevents.
OL,16,FThe course runs the length of the
OL,17,FIsland, north to south:
OL,19,FPoint of Ayre to Bride, then on through
OL,20,FThe Lhen and Jurby West to Ballaugh
OL,21,FCronk
